{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/fbcf39f7ffa17b042c9922d76df57d6b.poster.avif?t=1772813486\" width=480 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/fbcf39f7ffa17b042c9922d76df57d6b.webm?t=1772813486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/fbcf39f7ffa17b042c9922d76df57d6b.mp4?t=1772813486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 8 Bit style Action RPG where You Are A Fourth Worlder in an afro-futurist colony; You lost a duel to a government's shaman and ended up trapped and sealed in a Nokia 3310 mobile application. Your goals? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1)\u00a0 Break out of the application by glitching the game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(2) Punching that shaman up in the face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3) Explore the Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(4) Combat monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(5) Collect and Trade Items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overworld Map:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first level and it acts as a connecting hub to multiple levels in the game. It features a Desert biome and a Cityscape biome with multiple enemy encounters, dungeons, puzzles &amp; boss fights. The overworld map connects to different game maps with different mechanics including a 3D Toon world &amp; a sidescrolling / platforming world. You encounter different enemies, NPC's and Combat styles as you traverse through these worlds alone or Coop with friends in the game's Multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/cf54427eb9f395e2045c0db35f3a399a.avif?t=1772813486\" width=1056 height=1728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Combat:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Dystopia RPG is mainly hand to hand and involves timing your attacks perfectly to land punches on the enemy or using one of the various game items e.g. bombs, arrows, to attack enemies from a distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/94cc57e95dd2d7a1734e6e11931e9719.poster.avif?t=1772813486\" width=400 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/94cc57e95dd2d7a1734e6e11931e9719.webm?t=1772813486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/extras/94cc57e95dd2d7a1734e6e11931e9719.mp4?t=1772813486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's music is a trove of songs across multiple genres including Reggae, Hip-hop and Afro-Highlife and Afro beats.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888070?t=1772813486","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/e543da3ee183b78854d212d61d7f34e55cb7a747/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772813486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888070/d915b7afe2c45f414deedb22bfdc429a208151e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772813486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888